      "why": "It is much cheaper at about 6.1 million VND, with a 3-year warranty, but it is only suited to roughly 180–350 L tanks (1,050 L/h, 16 W) and has no heater."
    },
    {
      "brand": "Oase",
      "model": "BioMaster² Thermo 850",
      "why": "This newer generation has an improved head and pre-filter, uses less energy, and Oase claims more flow. Check local availability first."
    }
  ],
